                    response: I propose to incorporate                          
                    skin‐tone fairness by using a                               
                    WeightedRandomSampler in the training                       
                    DataLoader, where each sample’s weight                      
                    is set inverse to its skin‐tone group                       
                    frequency. This will force the model                        
                    to see balanced skin‐tone                                   
                    representation each epoch without                           
