                    generating mixed inputs and labels for                      
                    each batch using a Beta-distributed                         
                    mixing coefficient (alpha=0.4). This                        
                    encourages the model to learn smoother                      
                    decision boundaries and can improve                         
                    both overall AUROC and reduce bias                          
                    across skin tones. We modify                                
                    `train_one_epoch` to perform MixUp,                         
