                    successfully without any errors. The                        
                    model was trained using a weighted                          
                    sampler to ensure fairness across skin                      
                    tones, and test-time augmentation (TTA)                     
                    was used during evaluation. The                             
                    cross-validation results show a                             
                    consistent AUROC around 0.906,                              
                    indicating good model performance and                       
                    stability. The model was retrained on                       
                    the full dataset and saved successfully                     
